    "font size" : 9.963,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "The paper is organized as follows: In section 2, we introduce Bayesian inversion framework and the Fisher information adaptive MALA. We outline the finite-dimensional Bayesian approach, describe the Fisher adaptive MALA process, and develop the convergence analysis. Section 3 presents numerical experiments for Bayesian inverse problems that demonstrate the effectiveness of this algorithm and compare its performance with other methods. Section 4 concludes the paper with a summary of the main findings and a discussion of potential directions for future research."
  }, {
    "type" : "heading",
    "pdfua_tag" : "H1",
    "id" : 7,
    "level" : "Doctitle",
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 72.0, 662.884, 418.893, 677.245 ],
    "heading level" : 1,
    "font" : "CMBX12",
    "font size" : 14.346,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "2 Fisher Adaptive MALA in Bayesian inversion"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
