    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 72.0, 630.218, 540.003, 652.136 ],
    "font" : "CMR10",
    "font size" : 9.963,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "In this section, we review the Bayesian approach to inverse problems. Then, we apply the Fisher adaptive MALA to sample from the Bayesian posterior distributions arising in inverse problems."
