    "font" : "CMR10",
    "font size" : 9.963,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "Throughout this work, we consider the inverse problem of finding an unknown parameter x ∈ Rd from data y ∈ Rn, where the relationship between x and y is described by the following model"
